  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-model-allowance",
      "text": "[中文](README.zh.md)\n\nShows the balance or remaining allowance of the provider behind the current\nconversation model."
    },
    {
      "section": "Supported",
      "text": "- DeepSeek\n- MiniMax Coding Plan\n- Zhipu Coding Plan\n- Kimi for Coding\n- OpenCode Go"
    },
    {
      "section": "Not supported",
      "text": "- Qwen Token Plan: the vendor publishes no balance API"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from npm (recommended)",
      "text": "1. Open the **Plugins** page in the DSH sidebar.\n2. Choose **Install** and enter:\n\n```\n   dsh-model-allowance@1.0.0\n   ```\n\nUse the latest published version instead of `1.0.0` when a newer one\n   exists.\n3. Confirm the installation. If DSH reports **restart required**, restart\n   DSH; otherwise refresh the page.\n\nThe npm installation is eligible for the Plugin Manager's **Update** action."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from GitHub",
      "text": "```\ngit+https://github.com/MeiK2333/dsh-model-allowance.git#v1.0.0\n```\n\nGit installations are not covered by the Plugin Manager's **Update** action;\nupdating means removing the old version first, then installing the new tag."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness `>=0.2.1-rc.5 <0.3.0`."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE). Provider icons are trademarks of their respective owners,\nused only to identify them."
    }
  ],
